<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>热搜榜 - 百度热搜</title><link>https://top.baidu.com/board?tab=realtime</link><atom:link href="http://rss.wudifeixue.com/baidu/top" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"></atom:link><description>百度热搜以数亿用户海量的真实数据为基础，通过专业的数据挖掘方法，计算关键词的热搜指数，旨在建立权威、全面、热门、时效的各类关键词排行榜，引领热词阅读时代。 - Made with love by RSSHub(https://github.com/DIYgod/RSSHub)</description><generator>RSSHub</generator><webMaster>i@diygod.me (DIYgod)</webMaster><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 01 Apr 2025 00:17:51 GMT</lastBuildDate><ttl>5</ttl><item><title>从这场会见 看中国信心与机遇</title><description>&lt;img src=&quot;https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/00160812df88342159ccbc76022f8abf&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;     3月28日，习近平主席在北京会见国际工商界代表，40余位外资企业全球董事长、首席执行官和商协会代表纷至沓来。从这场会见的问题导向，看中国信心与机遇。</description><link>https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%BB%8E%E8%BF%99%E5%9C%BA%E4%BC%9A%E8%A7%81+%E7%9C%8B%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E4%BF%A1%E5%BF%83%E4%B8%8E%E6%9C%BA%E9%81%87</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%BB%8E%E8%BF%99%E5%9C%BA%E4%BC%9A%E8%A7%81+%E7%9C%8B%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E4%BF%A1%E5%BF%83%E4%B8%8E%E6%9C%BA%E9%81%87</guid></item><item><title>东部战区组织舰机多向抵近台岛</title><description>&lt;img src=&quot;https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/d1048f9aad242d37d701f2404c85793d&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;     4月1日开始，中国人民解放军东部战区组织陆军、海军、空军、火箭军等兵力，位台岛周边组织舰机多向抵近台岛，开展联合演训。</description><link>https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%B8%9C%E9%83%A8%E6%88%98%E5%8C%BA%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E8%88%B0%E6%9C%BA%E5%A4%9A%E5%90%91%E6%8A%B5%E8%BF%91%E5%8F%B0%E5%B2%9B</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%B8%9C%E9%83%A8%E6%88%98%E5%8C%BA%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E8%88%B0%E6%9C%BA%E5%A4%9A%E5%90%91%E6%8A%B5%E8%BF%91%E5%8F%B0%E5%B2%9B</guid></item><item><title>美制裁6名中国官员 中方：必将反制</title><description>&lt;img src=&quot;https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/2fe6e124dcf7f0c46c46aaa2a7f79209&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;     近日，外交部驻港公署发言人称：针对美国“制裁”6名中国中央政府驻港机构和香港特区政府官员，表示强烈谴责，坚决反对。</description><link>https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E7%BE%8E%E5%88%B6%E8%A3%816%E5%90%8D%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%98%E5%91%98+%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%B9%EF%BC%9A%E5%BF%85%E5%B0%86%E5%8F%8D%E5%88%B6</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E7%BE%8E%E5%88%B6%E8%A3%816%E5%90%8D%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%98%E5%91%98+%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%B9%EF%BC%9A%E5%BF%85%E5%B0%86%E5%8F%8D%E5%88%B6</guid></item><item><title>中国迎来人工智能加速应用期</title><description>&lt;img src=&quot;https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/03a0bc25ab26805e704b97ef9b7c7e3d&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;     AI技术井喷的浪潮下，2025年会是AI应用大规模落地的元年。业界人士指出，我们要激活产业发展动能，加速人工智能赋能千行百业、走进千家万户。</description><link>https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E8%BF%8E%E6%9D%A5%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%A0%E9%80%9F%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8%E6%9C%9F</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E8%BF%8E%E6%9D%A5%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%A0%E9%80%9F%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8%E6%9C%9F</guid></item><item><title>东部战区发布军事行动海报《进逼》</title><description>&lt;img src=&quot;https://fyb-1.cdn.bcebos.com/fyb/de6163834f53ca92c1273fff98ac9078.jpeg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;     </description><link>https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%B8%9C%E9%83%A8%E6%88%98%E5%8C%BA%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%83%E5%86%9B%E4%BA%8B%E8%A1%8C%E5%8A%A8%E6%B5%B7%E6%8A%A5%E3%80%8A%E8%BF%9B%E9%80%BC%E3%80%8B</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%B8%9C%E9%83%A8%E6%88%98%E5%8C%BA%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%83%E5%86%9B%E4%BA%8B%E8%A1%8C%E5%8A%A8%E6%B5%B7%E6%8A%A5%E3%80%8A%E8%BF%9B%E9%80%BC%E3%80%8B</guid></item><item><title>王伟烈士墓前摆了一张神秘照</title><description>&lt;img src=&quot;https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/b6f0c567ffe2a4ed20920b74a42bd20b&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;     临近4月1日，多地陆续举行纪念“海空卫士”王伟的活动。烈士的墓前，摆满了歼-35模型，还有一张神秘照片。</description><link>https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E7%8E%8B%E4%BC%9F%E7%83%88%E5%A3%AB%E5%A2%93%E5%89%8D%E6%91%86%E4%BA%86%E4%B8%80%E5%BC%A0%E7%A5%9E%E7%A7%98%E7%85%A7</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E7%8E%8B%E4%BC%9F%E7%83%88%E5%A3%AB%E5%A2%93%E5%89%8D%E6%91%86%E4%BA%86%E4%B8%80%E5%BC%A0%E7%A5%9E%E7%A7%98%E7%85%A7</guid></item><item><title>省委书记会见“全网最爱发钱老板”</title><description>&lt;img src=&quot;https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/009f16a998c16cf135004453de78f008&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;     3月30日，2025全球豫商大会在郑州举行，省委书记刘宁会见了参会的海内外豫商代表，并且还见到了“全网最爱发钱”的企业家。</description><link>https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E7%9C%81%E5%A7%94%E4%B9%A6%E8%AE%B0%E4%BC%9A%E8%A7%81%E2%80%9C%E5%85%A8%E7%BD%91%E6%9C%80%E7%88%B1%E5%8F%91%E9%92%B1%E8%80%81%E6%9D%BF%E2%80%9D</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E7%9C%81%E5%A7%94%E4%B9%A6%E8%AE%B0%E4%BC%9A%E8%A7%81%E2%80%9C%E5%85%A8%E7%BD%91%E6%9C%80%E7%88%B1%E5%8F%91%E9%92%B1%E8%80%81%E6%9D%BF%E2%80%9D</guid></item><item><title>李嘉诚卖港口将被审查 外交部回应</title><description>&lt;img src=&quot;https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/3e31f5a30575387b5dbb5e03ea9d6e01&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;     3月31日，外交部发言人郭嘉昆回应李嘉诚卖港口将被审查：中方一贯坚决反对利用经济胁迫、霸道霸凌侵犯损害他国正当权益的行为。</description><link>https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E6%9D%8E%E5%98%89%E8%AF%9A%E5%8D%96%E6%B8%AF%E5%8F%A3%E5%B0%86%E8%A2%AB%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5+%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%A4%E9%83%A8%E5%9B%9E%E5%BA%94</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E6%9D%8E%E5%98%89%E8%AF%9A%E5%8D%96%E6%B8%AF%E5%8F%A3%E5%B0%86%E8%A2%AB%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5+%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%A4%E9%83%A8%E5%9B%9E%E5%BA%94</guid></item><item><title>特朗普威胁伊朗：谈不拢就轰炸</title><description>&lt;img src=&quot;https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/285fa54cd8b422614c540a6467d7bd17&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;     近日，特朗普威胁称若伊朗不能达成核协议将对伊朗实施轰炸，伊朗表示将严厉回应。伊朗拒绝与美